  "details": "These new nametags are bloated and annoying. They take up far more screen space than the older ones.\n\nThe intent to make pronouns more visible ended up making it less visible. The “Subtitle” format was far more useful with the vertical layout, as a nominal portion was increased.\n\nName-tags are designed to be compact identifiers to give the player more information, the current design is choosing aesthetics over utility. If subtitles needed to increase more visibility, then a Larger Horizontal increase with a slight Vertical increase would have been far more visually clear and appealing. Keeping with the Right-hand-aligned format that can be increased would have been far more flexible than bloating the size of the ENTIRE nametag.\n\nEven in the Developer's own dev blog, it shows how bloated they look in the before and after",
